@startsalt
' Screen: Schedule Configuration Form
' User Stories:
'   - As an admin, I can schedule a script to run on a cron expression
'   - As a developer, I can see a human-readable preview of the cron expression
'   - As an admin, I can select which agent version to use for this schedule
'   - As an admin, I can enable or disable the schedule without deleting it
'   - As an admin, I can see the next calculated fire times before saving

{
  <b>codefre.sh</b> | Dashboard | Scripts | Prompts | Agents | <b>Schedules</b> | Settings
  ==
  {
    [< Back to Schedules]  |  <b>Edit Schedule: nightly-code-audit</b>  |  [Save]  [Delete Schedule]
  }
  ==
  {
    <b>Script</b>
    ..
    Script:        ^nightly-code-audit^   <i>(select the script to run)</i>
    Script Version: (X) Latest  () Pin to version: ^v12^
    ==

    <b>Timing</b>
    ..
    Cron Expression:  "0 3 * * *               "
    ..
    {+
      <color:green>✓ Valid expression</color>
      Human-readable: <b>Every day at 03:00 UTC</b>
    }
    ..
    Timezone:  ^UTC^
    ..
    {
      Available timezones:
      (X) UTC
      () America/New_York   (EST/EDT)
      () America/Los_Angeles (PST/PDT)
      () Europe/London      (GMT/BST)
      () Asia/Tokyo         (JST)
      () Custom: "                        "
    }
    ==

    <b>Agent</b>
    ..
    Agent:         ^gpt4o-primary^
    Agent Version: (X) Latest  () Pin to version: ^v3^
    ..
    <i><color:green>● gpt4o-primary — Healthy (checked 08:14 UTC)</color></i>
    ==

    <b>Execution</b>
    ..
    Enabled:       [X] Active — this schedule will fire
    ..
    On Failure:    ^Notify + Retry^
    Max Retries:   "2        "
    Retry Delay:   "5        "  minutes
    Notification:  "keith.brings@noizu.com  "
    ==

    <b>Next Fire Times (preview)</b>
    ..
    {+
      1. 2026-05-13 03:00:00 UTC
      2. 2026-05-14 03:00:00 UTC
      3. 2026-05-15 03:00:00 UTC
      <i>(calculated from current time: 2026-05-12 09:22 UTC)</i>
    }
    ==

    [Save]  [Save & Enable]  [Delete Schedule]  [Cancel]
  }
}
@endsalt
